ses to durable leashes and everything in between, we've got tails wagging and pets purring with delight.</p>\r\n<p>Join us on this tail-wagging adventure and let's give your pet the happy and healthy life they deserve! 🐾🎉</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Product description:</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Full range of pet products from Pet talking buttons to bark deterrent to home electronics to feeding goods! Full collection here: <a href=\"https://www.pawkietalkie.com/collections/all-products\">https://www.pawkietalkie.com/collections/all-products</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"> Signature product:</span> <a title=\"Dog Talking Buttons | PawkieTalkie\" href=\"https://www.pawkietalkie.com/products/the-talking-button-set\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pet Talking Buttons</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</span> Premium quality, bigger buttons designed for large and small pets, secure recording lock, excellent sound quality, batteries included, larger mats</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Payment terms:</span> 30 days&nbsp;</span></p>",
